       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 2000 mg three times daily comes to 6 g/day, which is above the usual adult maximum of 4 g/day. That limit applies even with normal liver and kidney function. A 70 kg adult at 6 g/day is at risk of hepatotoxicity. A single 2000 mg dose is also higher than the standard 500\u20131000 mg.\n\nHere are some options:\n- **Standard dosing:** 1000 mg PO three times daily (3 g/day), or 1000 mg PO four times daily (4 g/day, the maximum).\n- **Weight-based dosing:** 15 mg/kg is about 1000 mg per dose for 70 kg, given every 6 hours as needed.\n- **Something else intended:** If you meant a different dose or frequency, tell me and I'll enter it.\n\nIf you really do want 2000 mg three times daily, tell me and include a reason. I can add that to the order note, but I'd suggest checking it with pharmacy first.\n\nWhich would you like me to enter?"
      }
